18	// so a caller never has to know which flow raised a record — and the split is
19	// what lets each flow fetch, and later version-range, only its own.
20	//
21	// All records are equal — there is no active/archived split and no cleanup pass;
22	// FETCHING decides relevance. Vendoring ships only the records landed within
